      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "13",
        "text": "The table gives two points on a line. The line passes through the point whose x-coordinate is shown by the vertical line below. Find k, the y-coordinate of that point."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "16",
        "text": "First, find the slope from the two points:"
      },
      {
        "type": "expression",
        "id": "90",
        "hidden": true,
        "latex": "\\frac{10-46}{5-\\left(-4\\right)}"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "91",
        "text": "Then use the slope and one point to find the y-intercept:"
      },
      {
        "type": "expression",
        "id": "92",
        "hidden": true,
        "latex": "10-\\left(-4\\right)\\cdot5"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "17",
        "text": "A table holds the two points, a linear regression fits the line, and the vertical line marks the target x."
      },
      {
        "id": "27",
        "type": "table",
        "columns": [
          {
            "values": [
              "-4",
              "5"
            ],
            "hidden": true,
            "id": "25",
            "color": "#000000",
            "latex": "x_{2}"
          },
          {
            "values": [
              "46",
              "10"
            ],
            "id": "26",
            "color": "#c74440",
            "latex": "y_{2}"
          }
        ],
        "regression": {
          "type": "linear",
          "columnIds": {
            "x": "25",
            "y": "26"
          },
          "id": "29",
          "color": "#388c46",
          "lineStyle": "SOLID",
          "hidden": false,
          "isLogMode": false,
          "residualVariable": "e_{2}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "expression",
        "id": "30",
        "color": "#6042a6",
        "latex": "x=\\frac{3}{8}"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "93",
        "text": "The answer is the y value where the regression line meets the vertical line."
